Design Pattern Selection Cheat Sheet

          | Problem                     | Pattern                 |
          | --------------------------- | ----------------------- |
          | One instance only           | Singleton               |
          | Object creation logic       | Factory                 |
          | Complex object construction | Builder                 |
          | Runtime algorithm selection | Strategy                |
          | Event notification          | Observer                |
          | Third-party integration     | Adapter                 |
          | Add behavior dynamically    | Decorator               |
          | Simplify subsystem          | Facade                  |
          | Access control              | Proxy                   |
          | Request processing pipeline | Chain of Responsibility |
          | Workflow skeleton           | Template Method         |




        




      





      
